  lines:
  - "Replaying these scenes over and over\u2026"
  - "Most don\u2019t even bother."
  - At least not the painful ones.
  - "You regret your life, don\u2019t you?"
  - How you lived it.
  - Your decisions.
  - "<?ShakeCamera><?CamSwitchSpeed=.5><shake a=1>Even if you did have a second chance\u2026"
  - <?ShakeCamera><?CamSwitchSpeed=.5><shake a=1>Would you waste it like the first?
